WEBVTT

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.130
Zero kara kakedashite

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.130
Start running from the beginning,

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:08.500
Omoi dake wo dakishimete

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:08.500
with nothing but your emotions in your hands.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.890
Sonomama kakenukete

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.890
Just keep running...

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:18.350
Itsumo koko de mitsumeteru

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:18.350
I'm always watching you from here.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:42.300
Hajimete deatta hi no manazashi wasurenai

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:42.300
I still remember your expression the day we first met.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:49.190
Taiyou mitai ni kokoro wo terashitekureta

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:49.190
It lit up my heart like the sun.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:56.960
Asu no yukue sagashite nayandeiru nara

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:56.960
If you're anxious about where to go tomorrow,

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:06.890
Ima kimi no tame ni akari ni naritai yo

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:06.890
I want to become a beacon to you.

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.010
Zero kara tobidatte

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.010
Start flying from the beginning.

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:16.380
Ima no kimi wo toki hanachi

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:16.380
Let go of your current self...

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:19.730
Mugen ni habataite

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:19.730
and fly towards infinity.

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.600
Donna toki mo mimaru yo

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.600
I will always watch over you...

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.510
Kitto zutto tooku made

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.510
no matter how far you fly.

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:36.080
Episode 29 - Camilla's Portrait

00:01:36.260 --> 00:01:37.620
When you're an actor,

00:01:37.620 --> 00:01:40.410
you <i>absolutely cannot</i> let your character's mask fall!

00:01:40.410 --> 00:01:42.300
Do you actually consider yourself a contender for the role of the Scarlet Angel?!

00:01:43.110 --> 00:01:45.100
Aren't all the hardships you've endured up until now...

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:49.500
supposed to prepare you for that role?

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:51.010
So, you couldn't perform because of hecklers?

00:01:51.550 --> 00:01:54.300
Then, wear earplugs for your next show!

00:01:54.870 --> 00:01:57.140
My next show?

00:01:57.140 --> 00:01:59.500
You'll be performing in a folk-piece put on by the Canola Blossom Troupe.

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:02.260
I'm sorry, but I can't go on stage anymore.

00:02:03.030 --> 00:02:06.810
Whenever I think about my mom, I can't move.

00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:08.510
I can't act.

00:02:08.510 --> 00:02:09.800
I'm inadequate as an actress.

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:13.200
This isn't a request. This is an order.

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:14.280
I refuse!

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:17.370
You killed my mother and I hate you!

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:22.190
You can hate me all you want, but are you going to throw yourself away over it?

00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:25.630
This is your chance to get back on your feet.

00:02:25.630 --> 00:02:27.940
Why would I want to get back on my feet?

00:02:28.360 --> 00:02:30.040
I suppose you won't listen if I tell you...

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:31.690
to do this for yourself.

00:02:32.270 --> 00:02:34.420
So, I'll tell you to do it for Daito Entertainment.

00:02:35.110 --> 00:02:39.530
Don't forget that you still belong to Daito. You still belong to me.

00:02:39.530 --> 00:02:41.340
You will obey me.

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:42.310
Coward!

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:46.680
Fine by me! If you've got enough spunk to backchat, you've got enough to get back on stage.

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:50.670
Now, go. Get on with your next show.

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:53.610
I know we might be one of the least popular groups in this department,

00:02:53.610 --> 00:02:56.030
attracting the smallest audiences,

00:02:56.030 --> 00:02:59.360
but that doesn't mean we want some fallen diva coming in here...

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:01.300
and messing everything up!

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:04.360
I hear that you froze on stage during your last show with Apollo.

00:03:06.190 --> 00:03:08.140
We don't need a scarecrow.

00:03:16.350 --> 00:03:22.500
Are you telling me that you want to hear about my horrifying experience?

00:03:23.480 --> 00:03:28.370
It is an incident I cannot banish from my memories, no matter how hard I try.

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:32.670
At the time, I was living in an old castle deep in the forest,

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:36.310
with only my father and his servants for company.

00:03:36.310 --> 00:03:39.670
Each day was as lonely as the one before.

00:03:39.670 --> 00:03:41.500
I was still very young when I first had the dream that would...

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:44.340
leave such a terrifying impression on me.

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:47.970
It happened one night... when I was just a girl.

00:03:47.970 --> 00:03:50.460
This is when it all began.

00:04:09.740 --> 00:04:12.300
That girl's truly scared.

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:18.660
Who are you? Where did you come from?

00:04:19.160 --> 00:04:22.680
My name is Maria... I'm all alone.

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:25.340
When I opened my eyes, there was no-one around and...

00:04:28.670 --> 00:04:32.060
Don't cry. I'm here now.

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:38.300
What's wrong, Maria?!

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:45.720
What's happened?

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:48.920
This woman appeared... I don't know who she was!

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:50.770
And then, she bit me on the neck!

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:51.750
She bit you?!

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:54.270
That's right! She's hiding under the bed!

00:04:54.900 --> 00:04:58.250
There's nobody under the bed, sir.

00:04:58.250 --> 00:05:00.930
No, you're lying! She's under there!

00:04:58.250 --> 00:05:02.330
I'm at a disadvantage in this show...

00:05:02.330 --> 00:05:03.870
Even though I'm meant to be the star!

00:05:04.890 --> 00:05:07.000
Now, we'll face off.

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:10.970
Miss Maria, we need to get back to the castle!

00:05:10.970 --> 00:05:14.650
Oh, won't you let me walk in the forest for a little bit longer?

00:05:14.650 --> 00:05:17.770
There's nothing to do in the castle - it's so boring.

00:05:17.770 --> 00:05:21.150
And this sunset is just beautiful.

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:27.140
Miss, are you all right?

00:05:28.110 --> 00:05:30.640
Can you please aid us?

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:32.620
The horse took fright and threw her off.

00:05:41.630 --> 00:05:43.900
Camilla, are you all right?

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:46.270
I'm finding it hard to breathe...

00:05:48.150 --> 00:05:56.140
We agreed to let Camilla stay at the castle until her injuries healed.

00:05:59.440 --> 00:06:01.680
This is so strange.

00:06:01.680 --> 00:06:06.680
You look exactly like a girl I used to see in my dreams when I was a little girl!

00:06:06.680 --> 00:06:11.240
And you look like someone I used to see in my dreams when I was a child too.

00:06:11.240 --> 00:06:14.890
I was sleeping in the bed you're sleeping in now!

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:17.360
That's so weird!

00:06:17.820 --> 00:06:24.500
In that dream, I'd walk into an unfamiliar room. It was this room...

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:25.930
I remember it by its decor!

00:06:25.930 --> 00:06:33.720
I'd find a beautiful blonde girl crying in this bed... That's it! The girl was you!

00:06:34.270 --> 00:06:39.180
That's so strange. You see, I used to have the exact same dream.

00:06:39.550 --> 00:06:45.250
This must mean we're destined to become friends. Don't you agree, Maria?

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:46.510
What do you mean, Camilla?

00:06:46.850 --> 00:06:52.410
I've been ill and alone for such a long time.

00:06:52.410 --> 00:06:58.910
I was healthy once, but that was so long ago.

00:06:58.910 --> 00:07:00.350
I used to be so happy.

00:07:00.350 --> 00:07:03.490
This isn't the expression she wore in rehearsals!

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:08.340
Let's become the best of friends, okay?

00:07:08.850 --> 00:07:12.330
Oh, I'm so happy we met!

00:07:12.670 --> 00:07:18.400
I've been drawn to you ever since I had that dream.

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:24.910
Camilla ate next to nothing, she avoided the sun and then, for some reason,

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:25.840
when it came to roses...

00:07:48.560 --> 00:07:51.790
This body is a curse!

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:55.350
But all you've done is take a walk in the woods.

00:07:55.940 --> 00:07:59.060
The sun and the open air do this to me.

00:07:59.060 --> 00:08:01.850
It was cloudy this morning, so I thought I'd be all right.

00:08:04.980 --> 00:08:06.890
You really hate roses, don't you?

00:08:07.480 --> 00:08:10.980
I can't imagine why you'd hate touching them so!

00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:16.660
Her cowardly portrayal of the heroine is a disgrace to all actors.

00:08:16.660 --> 00:08:20.540
Do you think talent and skill are the only way to express yourself on stage?

00:08:20.540 --> 00:08:23.190
Let me show you what you lack.

00:08:35.400 --> 00:08:37.500
Such a long pause...

00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:40.070
What are you trying to do, Ayumi Himekawa?!

00:08:41.420 --> 00:08:48.670
When I was young and still healthy, I loved playing in the forest!

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:52.710
Whether it was in the sunshine, playing in the river,

00:08:52.710 --> 00:08:55.550
or riding horses to the top of mountains. I enjoyed it all.

00:08:56.050 --> 00:09:00.060
I had so many friends back then. I was so happy.

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:05.310
But, those days are gone forever.

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:08.250
How can you possibly look so... sad?!

00:09:08.880 --> 00:09:11.570
She's supposed to be a vampire!

00:09:11.570 --> 00:09:16.990
How strange. The audience is totally transfixed on Camilla, not the star.

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:17.920
You're right.

00:09:18.350 --> 00:09:21.680
Back then, I too loved roses.

00:09:30.410 --> 00:09:32.650
The vampire's crying!

00:09:38.190 --> 00:09:41.220
She's made herself into the heroine...

00:09:47.410 --> 00:09:49.720
This just shows the gulf between the two of you in terms of talent.

00:09:49.720 --> 00:09:52.650
You really need to pull it together or you're finished!

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:55.810
Maya, my only rival... I have avenged you.

00:09:57.680 --> 00:10:02.720
Where are you and what are you doing right now?

00:10:06.280 --> 00:10:07.980
I've had enough!

00:10:07.980 --> 00:10:10.320
If it's really that embarrassing for you to act in such a small production,

00:10:10.320 --> 00:10:11.190
then go elsewhere!

00:10:11.860 --> 00:10:14.130
You think we'll let you just not take the rehearsals seriously?

00:10:14.130 --> 00:10:17.430
Everyone else here is giving their all!

00:10:18.210 --> 00:10:21.690
I can't act anymore.

00:10:22.380 --> 00:10:27.670
Mom, I'm quitting acting!

00:10:30.970 --> 00:10:33.800
The show was a roaring success, don't you think?

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:35.690
Yes. You did a great job, Father!

00:10:35.690 --> 00:10:40.310
And now that you've avenged your rival, you're happy as well.

00:10:42.010 --> 00:10:43.440
Father!

00:10:44.130 --> 00:10:50.180
She really means a lot to you, doesn't she? This Maya Kitajima.

00:10:50.180 --> 00:10:54.560
I couldn't bear to see her driven away in such an underhanded manner.

00:10:54.560 --> 00:10:57.970
She shouldn't be allowed to just fall apart like that!

00:10:58.470 --> 00:11:01.340
I'm waiting for her to get back on her feet.

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:07.220
Then, we're going to fight for the role of the Scarlet Angel, fair and square!

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:09.980
You've noticed then, haven't you, Ayumi?

00:11:10.570 --> 00:11:13.680
You've noticed that your fates are interlaced.

00:11:13.680 --> 00:11:15.540
By the way, Ayumi...

00:11:15.540 --> 00:11:17.770
Yes, I know. I promised to appear in one of your movies.

00:11:17.770 --> 00:11:20.510
Okay. I'll play any role you ask me to, Father.

00:11:20.510 --> 00:11:24.010
Good. The shoot will last for three months.

00:11:24.010 --> 00:11:25.390
The location is this house.

00:11:25.390 --> 00:11:26.550
What?

00:11:27.520 --> 00:11:30.120
Will you play the role of my daughter?

00:11:30.610 --> 00:11:33.320
I get lonely when you're not around.

00:11:33.320 --> 00:11:35.150
Oh, Dad!

00:11:36.360 --> 00:11:38.550
What do you mean she's disappeared?!

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:43.300
The troupe said that she couldn't act at all.

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:45.000
Couldn't act at all?

00:11:45.450 --> 00:11:49.010
I have a feeling she won't be coming back here either.

00:11:59.500 --> 00:12:02.550
What will I do now?

00:12:03.870 --> 00:12:08.040
All the people around me have disappeared.

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:16.540
All I had was acting, so now... I have nothing.

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:24.730
How did he find me?

00:12:27.980 --> 00:12:31.570
I know you don't have anywhere else to go, so I figured you'd be here.

00:12:31.940 --> 00:12:33.760
Come on, we're going back.

00:12:33.760 --> 00:12:37.590
No! I won't! Please, just leave me alone!

00:12:38.240 --> 00:12:42.440
I'm done with acting. I'm going back to being the person I used to be!

00:12:42.890 --> 00:12:45.580
You want to go back to being worthless?

00:12:45.580 --> 00:12:47.410
That's right!

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:49.530
So please, just leave me alone.

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:53.480
I'm asking you to leave.

00:12:58.690 --> 00:13:00.130
Maya!

00:13:02.610 --> 00:13:04.070
Call a doctor!

00:13:04.070 --> 00:13:06.010
She's soaked through!

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:07.750
Please bring her a change of clothes.

00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:10.750
What's going on?

00:13:10.750 --> 00:13:16.090
Well, the young master- I mean, Mr. Masumi, has brought a girl home.

00:13:16.620 --> 00:13:19.100
You're telling me that Masumi brought a girl home?

00:13:19.600 --> 00:13:22.120
Yes. A high school girl.

00:13:22.120 --> 00:13:23.650
I believe this is the same girl that Chigusa Tsukikage...

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:26.230
has named as one of the contenders for the role of the Scarlet Angel.

00:13:26.740 --> 00:13:28.750
Chigusa Tsukikage, huh?

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:34.750
I have dreamed of producing that show for a very long time.

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:41.210
It's my fault that your mother died and everything that's happened since...

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:44.340
is all my fault as well.

00:13:44.640 --> 00:13:52.860
My chest hurts. Up until now, I've always felt that the end justifies the means!

00:13:52.860 --> 00:13:54.140
What's wrong with me?

00:13:54.140 --> 00:13:58.480
Have I started to slip as well?

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:05.310
I've been drawn to your passion on stage for such a long time, but...

00:14:05.310 --> 00:14:08.830
I didn't want to acknowledge my own feelings.

00:14:08.830 --> 00:14:13.800
I didn't want to admit that I was this affected by a girl eleven years younger than me.

00:14:14.560 --> 00:14:20.740
I got you into this mess and now, I'm going to get you out of it.

00:14:21.800 --> 00:14:28.150
I'll revive your passion and set you on the right path towards the Scarlet Angel.

00:14:28.150 --> 00:14:36.400
Maya, no matter how much you hate me, I will help you get it all back.

00:14:43.710 --> 00:14:45.560
Where am I?

00:14:45.560 --> 00:14:48.390
Oh, you shouldn't be out of bed yet!

00:14:48.390 --> 00:14:49.520
Where am I?

00:14:49.520 --> 00:14:52.050
This is Master Masumi's house.

00:14:52.050 --> 00:14:55.520
Last night, you collapsed with pneumonia.

00:14:55.520 --> 00:14:58.390
Yuck, these are men's pajamas!

00:14:58.390 --> 00:15:00.280
Those are Master Masumi's!

00:15:00.280 --> 00:15:02.560
Gross!

00:15:03.610 --> 00:15:08.970
I'm sure Master Masumi is relieved that he can entrust his entire company to his son.

00:15:08.970 --> 00:15:11.300
Mr. Masumi is a great man!

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:13.470
After all, they're not even related by blood.

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:14.270
What?

00:15:14.270 --> 00:15:18.290
Oh, don't tell anyone I told you this.

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:27.000
Mr. Hayami's mother came to work here as a maid after her husband died.

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:33.430
Maybe it was because he had lived alone for so long that Mr. Masumi decided to go against...

00:15:33.430 --> 00:15:36.020
his parents wishes and married her.

00:15:36.840 --> 00:15:40.190
Mr. Hayami lost his mother during junior high, and after that,

00:15:40.190 --> 00:15:43.240
he was fiercely trained to learn the family business, so it was over work...

00:15:43.240 --> 00:15:48.270
that the two really became father and son.

00:15:48.270 --> 00:15:51.200
They bonded over their work...

00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:53.390
Masumi Hayami.

00:16:04.000 --> 00:16:09.590
I'm going to run away. I'll run away to a place so far away, he'll never find me again.

00:16:15.550 --> 00:16:18.600
Hey, girl!

00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:21.690
Hello... has anyone lost their little boy?

00:16:21.690 --> 00:16:23.590
Not this kid again.

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:27.580
Sakura Daycare

00:16:23.950 --> 00:16:26.860
He's from the daycare center near here.

00:16:27.600 --> 00:16:31.580
Thank you so much for looking after him.

00:16:31.580 --> 00:16:33.670
Oh, he was no trouble at all.

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:37.740
Daycare centers are pretty homely inside, aren't they?

00:16:37.740 --> 00:16:40.590
Well, the kids have made an ungodly mess.

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:42.990
We never have enough hands to look after them all, either.

00:16:42.990 --> 00:16:47.340
Um... well, would you please give me a job?!

00:16:48.630 --> 00:16:53.280
This is Maya. She will be helping us from today.

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:57.010
It's the girl from yesterday!

00:16:57.010 --> 00:16:58.960
I can forget.

00:16:58.960 --> 00:17:02.500
Here, I can forget everything.

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:05.490
I'm going to become a regular girl again.

00:17:05.990 --> 00:17:09.130
You're telling me that Maya Kitajima has <i>quit</i> acting?

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:09.120
The Tale of Princess Yasha

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:11.580
Apparently, even though Mr. Hayami...

00:17:11.580 --> 00:17:14.380
has been trying his best to get her to audition for roles, she's gone missing.

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:17.030
The rumors say that she no longer has the ability to act.

00:17:17.030 --> 00:17:20.400
So, the Scarlet Angel is all yours.

00:17:20.400 --> 00:17:23.270
Then, my rival has gone.

00:17:23.800 --> 00:17:27.460
I didn't realize she was that type of girl.

00:17:27.460 --> 00:17:29.260
I overestimated her.

00:17:30.330 --> 00:17:32.200
What a nice breeze.

00:17:32.200 --> 00:17:36.100
It smells like the sunset.

00:17:36.100 --> 00:17:41.760
It smells like the city, like the people... the breeze smells like life.

00:17:41.760 --> 00:17:46.270
I've forgotten all about the dusk breeze.

00:17:55.810 --> 00:17:59.310
Let me go!

00:17:59.310 --> 00:18:02.010
Let go of me! I hate you!

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:03.830
Let me go!

00:18:05.150 --> 00:18:06.450
Coward!

00:18:06.450 --> 00:18:07.970
Let me out!

00:18:07.970 --> 00:18:10.220
Am I on the wrong track?

00:18:10.220 --> 00:18:14.970
Trying to get you to recover with such drastic measures?

00:18:18.440 --> 00:18:20.980
She hasn't had a single bite again.

00:18:20.980 --> 00:18:23.140
So, this is day three.

00:18:23.140 --> 00:18:25.510
Is she trying to starve herself to death?

00:18:26.570 --> 00:18:31.060
So, even I have reached my wits' end. You really don't want stardom, do you?

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:36.850
That's a real shame, because I enjoyed watching you perform.

00:18:38.370 --> 00:18:43.040
I don't know who it was, but someone once said that the stage was a rainbow world.

00:18:43.040 --> 00:18:45.520
It is a fantasy world you can never fully grasp with your hands.

00:18:46.210 --> 00:18:49.720
Only actors can live in that world.

00:18:49.720 --> 00:18:53.520
Don't you think you'd like to go back and live through thousands,

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:54.980
even tens of thousands of lives?!

00:18:55.600 --> 00:18:57.420
In that rainbow world...

00:18:59.760 --> 00:19:01.090
Maya.

00:19:04.840 --> 00:19:06.840
Okay, I'll let you go.

00:19:08.110 --> 00:19:11.910
Daito has a show opening tomorrow and one of the actors has fallen ill.

00:19:12.650 --> 00:19:14.640
The role is not much bigger than a walk-on part,

00:19:14.640 --> 00:19:17.350
but would you take it as an understudy?

00:19:17.350 --> 00:19:20.040
This is the last thing I'll ask of you: after that, you're free to go.

00:19:20.040 --> 00:19:20.970
Fine.

00:19:21.270 --> 00:19:24.240
The play is called <i>The Tale of Princess Yasha</i>.

00:19:24.240 --> 00:19:25.670
Your character's name is Toki.

00:19:25.670 --> 00:19:27.210
She's an impoverished girl...

00:19:27.210 --> 00:19:30.640
who meets Princess Tama when the princess's rabble passes through her village.

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:34.430
Because she's cruel and merciless, Princess Tama is known by the nickname: Princess Yasha.

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:34.430
Translation Note: Yasha is a demon in Buddhist mythology.

00:19:34.800 --> 00:19:37.560
Tama will be played by Ayumi Himekawa.

00:19:37.560 --> 00:19:38.670
By Ayumi?

00:19:38.880 --> 00:19:41.200
Then, please bring me a script!

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:42.900
I'm going to start memorizing my lines right away!

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:50.870
My final play.

00:19:50.870 --> 00:19:54.100
This is the end for me.

00:19:55.440 --> 00:20:00.350
You can't seriously tell me they're giving her another shot on stage?!

00:20:00.350 --> 00:20:02.240
I have a great idea...

00:20:02.240 --> 00:20:06.690
Have you heard the rumors about Princess Tama?

00:20:06.690 --> 00:20:10.180
They say she had sixty-five peasants put to death last year, when they were late...

00:20:10.170 --> 00:20:12.530
This is it, then.

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:12.530
with their tributes.

00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:17.720
Do your best.

00:20:17.720 --> 00:20:19.520
I'll be watching from here.

00:20:19.520 --> 00:20:21.100
Farewell.

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:25.770
Is this the last time you'll walk on the rainbows?

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:30.510
In the end, there was nothing I could do for her.

00:20:30.510 --> 00:20:31.470
Thief!

00:20:31.470 --> 00:20:32.680
Get out of our village!

00:20:37.480 --> 00:20:40.560
Wow, they used a real rock!

00:20:40.560 --> 00:20:44.060
Drop what you've taken from us!

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:51.240
My peasants have behaved in a violent, despicable manner.

00:20:51.240 --> 00:20:52.990
We are not worthy!

00:20:52.990 --> 00:20:56.970
May I offer these cakes to you as an apology?

00:20:56.970 --> 00:21:00.360
Thank you very much, your ladyship!

00:21:02.780 --> 00:21:06.010
What are you doing here, Maya Kitajima?

00:21:06.820 --> 00:21:07.930
This is bad!

00:21:07.930 --> 00:21:12.840
There are meant to be cakes in that box for her to eat in this scene...

00:21:12.840 --> 00:21:14.970
but they've been thrown away!

00:21:14.970 --> 00:21:18.180
So, what are they going to feed her on stage?!

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:22.230
Please, eat as much as you like.

00:21:22.230 --> 00:21:23.780
Oh, you are too kind to us!

00:21:23.780 --> 00:21:25.360
Can you believe this, Toki?

00:21:26.630 --> 00:21:28.850
The cakes...

00:21:29.810 --> 00:21:31.860
are balls of mud!

00:21:31.860 --> 00:21:35.840
But the plot requires that I eat one!

00:21:38.670 --> 00:21:41.360
The whole play will be ruined!

00:21:46.050 --> 00:21:48.200
What should I do?

00:22:03.940 --> 00:22:18.080
Chikazukitai noni toozaketeshimau

00:22:03.940 --> 00:22:18.080
I want to be close to you, but you're distancing yourself.

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:31.320
Dakishimetai toki wazato hanareteshimau

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:31.320
When I want to hold you, you deliberately run away.

00:22:31.320 --> 00:22:44.070
Marude jishaku no N to N no you da ne

00:22:31.320 --> 00:22:44.070
We're like two poles on a magnet...

00:22:44.070 --> 00:22:55.190
Otagai amari nimo nisugita seikana?

00:22:44.070 --> 00:22:55.190
Maybe we're too alike?

00:22:55.190 --> 00:23:09.920
Motto motto sunao na hitomi de mitsureba

00:22:55.190 --> 00:23:09.920
If you allow your eyes to see the truth,

00:23:09.920 --> 00:23:21.510
Yodonderu izumi mo suki tooru hazusa

00:23:09.920 --> 00:23:21.510
even quagmires will become crystal clear.

00:23:22.060 --> 00:23:24.470
Everything had gone from my grasp...

00:23:24.470 --> 00:23:30.930
All my troubles and sorrow... I didn't even know who I was.

00:23:30.930 --> 00:23:35.490
I was able to become Toki. I was able to act again!

00:23:36.190 --> 00:23:39.940
But there's no stage out there for me.

00:23:39.940 --> 00:23:41.980
I want to act.

00:23:41.980 --> 00:23:45.380
I want to keep up with Ayumi, who still believes in me.

00:23:45.380 --> 00:23:47.560
I want to compete with her for the role of the Scarlet Angel.

00:23:46.540 --> 00:23:51.500
Episode 30 - A Million Rainbows

00:23:47.560 --> 00:23:50.500
I'll do it alone if I have to!
